                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "ABSTRACT: Siponimod is the first drug to delay the progress of disability in patients with active secondary progressive but lack of the combined using study a f drugs interaction with Siponimod，including CYP2C9 /CYP3A4 inducersand inhibitors，vaccines，contraceptives，immunomodulatory or inhibitory treatments，antiarrhythmic drugs，β-blockers，to provide a reference for combined use and avoid adverse factors in clinical use."
